    "body": "### Is it platform specific\n\ngeneric\n\n### Importance or Severity\n\nHigh\n\n### Description of the enhancement\n\nIntroducing new DRH topologies, we need to create a baseline for which tests are run or skipped via test topology markers and conditional markers.\n\nAs a starting baseline, we want to mimic what UT2 runs. Do this by attaching new topo types ('lrh', 'urh') to where we see UT2 (topo type T2 etc.)\n\n### Current Behavior\n\nDRH toplogies, LRH & URH, is not mentioned in any conditional or topology markers\n\n### Proposed Behavior\n\nAt a baseline, LRH & URH should run the same tests as UT2"
  },
